 an area on a map. Overlay objects are essentially data objects","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that contain the geographic data needed to represent the map area. Overlays can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"take the form of a polyline or polygon.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnoverlay","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNShapeSource","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or they may be defined by local or external","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GeoJSON","type":"text"},{"text":" code. A shape source is added to an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object along with an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object. The vector style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can update a shape source by setting its ","type":"text"},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPointCollectionFeature":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointcollectionfeature","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPointCollectionFeature","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNPointCollectionFeature","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollectionFeature","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollectionFeature","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object associates a point collection with an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"optional identifier and attributes.","type":"text"}]}}}